abstract: >-
  An open-source research-software platform for earthquake-event ingestion, data-quality control,
  spatiotemporal analytics, seismicity anomaly screening, Sentinel-1 acquisition discovery,
  deformation-product exploration, urban exposure analysis, interactive visualisation, APIs and
  reproducible exports focused on Türkiye.
